Sill Desktop Host
An unofficial build of Sill's Mac host.

Based on Sill (https://github.com/Saffsanity/sill), Copyright its authors,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).
Upstream commit: see UPSTREAM_COMMIT.

Changes in this copy (Apache 2.0, section 4b):
- App name, bundle ID and executable name: Sill Desktop Host, io.github.natehag.sill-desktop-host,
  SillDesktopHost, so it is never mistaken for Sill and never replaces it.
- Its own keychain entries for the host identity (service and key tag renamed).
- Automatic update checks off (Sill's releases are not this app's).
- Scripts/make-app.sh: the new file names; quits Sill.app before installing.
- Package.swift: the two probe targets left out.
Additions:
- Files both ways with Sill Viewer (Sources/SillHost/HostFiles.swift; message kinds 201–206 in
  StreamMessage.swift; WindowList.files; StreamServer.pendingBytes(of:); Info.plist folder notes).
- Fit screen and Match this screen for the whole desktop (Sources/SillHost/DesktopFit.swift;
  hooks in StreamCoordinator; Viewport.pixelWidth/pixelHeight/pixelScale;
  HostSettingsState.pixelMatch).
- Wakes the screens for a viewer and keeps them awake while one is connected; restarts the
  stream when the screens wake (Sources/SillHost/HostWake.swift; hooks in StreamCoordinator).
Later additions are listed in README.md.

This project is not made by, or affiliated with, the Sill team.
